@startuml
title 外卖点餐与配送系统：订单取消与退款
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

boundary "Customer UI" as CustomerUI
boundary "Merchant UI" as MerchantUI
boundary "Admin UI" as AdminUI
participant "Cancellation, Refund and Dispute" as Cancellation
participant "Order" as Order
participant "Inventory" as Inventory
participant "Mock Payment" as Payment
participant "Scheduled Jobs" as Scheduler
participant "Data Access" as DataAccess
database "Persistent Storage" as Storage
participant "Notification" as Notification
participant "Audit Log" as Audit

CustomerUI -> Cancellation : 请求取消订单并提交原因
Cancellation -> Order : 读取并核验最新订单状态
Order --> Cancellation : 当前状态及付款结果

alt 待付款或待商家接单：直接取消
  Cancellation -> Order : 原子转换为已取消
  Order -> DataAccess : 保存已取消状态
  DataAccess -> Storage : 持久化订单状态
  Cancellation -> Inventory : 按规则恢复库存且最多一次
  opt 已成功付款
    Cancellation -> Payment : 对原付款发起一次全额模拟退款
    Payment -> DataAccess : 保存退款请求和进度
    DataAccess -> Storage : 持久化退款记录
  end
else 制作中至待取餐：申请取消
  Cancellation -> DataAccess : 保存处理中的取消申请
  DataAccess -> Storage : 持久化申请和审批期限
  Cancellation -> Notification : 通知商家处理申请
  alt 商家在5分钟内处理
    MerchantUI -> Cancellation : 批准或拒绝
  else 商家5分钟未处理
    Scheduler -> Cancellation : 审批期限到达
    Cancellation -> Notification : 转管理员处理，申请仍为处理中
    AdminUI -> Cancellation : 批准或拒绝申请
  end
  alt 批准
    Cancellation -> Order : 核验最新状态并原子转换为已取消
    Order -> DataAccess : 保存订单与已批准申请
    DataAccess -> Storage : 同步持久化结果
    Cancellation -> Payment : 已付款则发起一次全额退款
    Payment -> DataAccess : 保存退款进度
    DataAccess -> Storage : 持久化退款记录
  else 拒绝
    Cancellation -> DataAccess : 保存已拒绝申请，订单状态不变
    DataAccess -> Storage : 持久化审批结果
  end
else 配送中或已送达
  Cancellation --> CustomerUI : 不进入普通取消；说明异常处理或售后入口
end

Cancellation -> Notification : 通知顾客及相关履约人员
Cancellation -> Audit : 记录申请、决定、订单及退款结果
Cancellation --> CustomerUI : 返回订单、申请与退款各自的结果
@enduml
